# madcide keybinding profile: JOE/WordStar-style — the default, the
# owner's full basic editing set. One binding per line: key sequence,
# spaces, action name (the LAST word). Sequences are space-separated key
# spellings, any length; letters are case-insensitive (^K S == ^K s).
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# File and exit
^k x savequit
^k d save
^k s save
^k r insertfile
^c discard
^k h help
^t options
^k z shell
# The IDE keys (owner ruling 2026-08-27): JOE's four control-key arrow
# synonyms (^B ^F ^P ^N — the WordStar diamond's control spellings) are
# RECLAIMED; the real arrow keys serve motion. ^R is JOE's retype.
# ^P raises the PROJECT window (owner ruling 2026-08-31: the project is
# ^P's primary function; quick-open rides its filter; esc dismisses).
# ^N raises the MODES palette (owner ruling 2026-08-31): ":" inside it
# enters the vi colon line (^N : — the @modes keys are data; the chord
# table cannot spell ^n : beside a bare ^n, so the palette IS the door).
# ^K E keeps editfile, which ^N used to shortcut.
^p project
^f find
^n modes
^b build
^r refresh
^k j projaddcur
# Movement (arrows/home/end/pgup/pgdn are the primary motion keys; these
# delegate to the one shared movement implementation — the action name
# is the key vocabulary)
^a home
^e end
^z wordleft
^x wordright
^u pgup
^v pgdn
^k u top
^k v bottom
^k l gotoline
# Editing
^d del
^y delline
^w delword
^_ undo
^^ redo
# Blocks
^k b mark
^k k bend
^k c blockcopy
^k m blockmove
^k y blockdel
# Search
^k f find
^l findnext
# Windows (IDE-9e) — JOE's verbs on their JOE seats (^K O/N/P/G/T);
# kill-this/keep-only ride ^K 0/^K 1 (JOE spells tw0/tw1 on Esc digits,
# but madcide's Esc closes panes by owner ruling, so the digits move
# under ^K — JOE's ^K digits are bookmarks, which madcide lacks; debt
# documented in the plan doc).
^k o splitw
^k n nextw
^k p prevw
^k g groww
^k t shrinkw
^k 0 killwin
^k 1 onlywin
# madcide
^k q quit
^k e editfile
^k ; check
^k i outline
^k a view
# The project window's keys (@project scope — pane/modal keys are
# profile DATA; the baked defaults add esc/backspace). Enter names what
# a CHOOSE means; ins prompts for the file to add; del removes the
# focused row's membership (never the file).
@project ins projadd
@project del projdel
@project enter projopen
